      "comment" : "Inbox, issue beside the list: one line of what happened, after the person's avatar. The user's own GitHub account assigned them to the issue, but not in this app (with the command line, a script or an AI agent signed in as them, or on github.com). GitHub doesn't notify anyone of what their own account does, so the app shows it.",
