      "comment" : "Notice (Mac: in the bottom corner of the window; iPhone, iPad: banner at the top) message: the change GitHub refused was dropped. %(change)@ is the change as listed in the changes waiting to be sent, e.g. 'Status changed to Done'. Use your language's quotation marks.",
