      "comment" : "Notice (Mac: in the bottom corner of the window; iPhone, iPad: banner at the top) message, first sentence: what someone else set the issue's due date to on GitHub. %(date)@ is day and short month, e.g. 'Oct 9'. Followed by 'Your change to … was applied last.'",
