    "parentDoneWithSubIssues" : {
      "comment" : "Notice (Mac: at the bottom of the window; iPhone and iPad: banner) after you finished the last open sub-issue of an issue, so the app moved that parent issue to Done as well (a setting). %(number)@ is the parent's number, such as '#9'; its title shows below. 'Done' as in finished.",
